NOTICE OF MODIFICATIONS
================================================================================
In accordance with Section 3 of the Gemma Terms of Use, notice is hereby given
that this model has been modified from the original Gemma base model:

1. Parameter-Efficient Fine-Tuning (PEFT) using LoRA (Low-Rank Adaptation):
   - Base Model: google/gemma-2b-it
   - Target Modules: q_proj, k_proj, v_proj, o_proj
   - Training Datasets: Multilingual instructional, programming logic (C++, Java, Web),
     ethical cybersecurity concepts, and Spanish conversational data.
2. Weight merging into full-precision BF16 SafeTensors format.
3. Quantization to GGUF format (Q4_K_M) optimized for zero-copy mmap execution
   on edge and mobile ARM64 hardware (Kofu Mobile Android runtime).

